<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Results of Qwen-2.5 7B/14B/32B/72B. The additional <math id="S4.T1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="o\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">o\%</annotation></semantics></math> for ARMOR pruned models represent the relative overhead of the block diagonal matricies. ARC-C is short for ARC-Challenge, Wino is short for WinoGrande, Hella is short for HellaSwag. (2.5-7B) denotes Qwen 2.5-7B, (2.5-14B) denotes Qwen 2.5-14B, etc.</figcaption>
